Z||000000||KillerX||11-23-2001||01:01 AM||||im putting in Mobil 1 and there was 5w-30 in there before. now when i do my oil change  and let all the old dirty oil out do i have to "flush" it sum how? or do i just put the new oil in (and damn this new oil is expensive! lol i thought it woulda been a couple bux more...ohh well what ever is good for my baby...)<BR>ThanX<P> <A HREF="http://WWW.Sweetride.8K.Com" TARGET=_blank>WWW.Sweetride.8K.Com</A>   &lt;--- Should be up in a couple days||||reg||10
